  "article_notes": "97 dogs with PCR/RLB-confirmed B. rossi at Onderstepoort OVAH (2011-2013) plus 15 healthy controls; serum and EDTA samples at admission before any treatment. Outcome: survival to discharge vs death or euthanasia for poor prognosis (12 died, 85 survived). Table 1 gives median (IQR) for 14 analytes per group; significance between survivors and non-survivors is shown by superscript b (P<0.05) and agrees with the Results text (IL-6 P=0.041, MCP-1 P=0.009; CRP, SAA and leukocyte counts not different). The comparison of dogs sick <=48 h vs >48 h before presentation is a duration-of-illness grouping, not a severity grouping, and was not extracted; infected vs control comparisons skipped. The cohort may overlap with other Onderstepoort B. rossi studies from the same period (not stated in the article).",
